Word blank document
-------------------

The theme, styles, font table, settings and web settings XML in
lib/src/docx/blank_document.dart are taken from a blank document saved by
Microsoft Word for Mac 16.114.1 (test/fixtures/owner/docx/blank.docx), with
the revision identifiers and document ids removed, and the regional
settings, style ids and style names normalised to Word's en-US defaults.
Whether that XML may ship under this package's licence is an open question
for the owner, not settled here.

Word built-in styles
--------------------

The style definitions in lib/src/docx/builtin_styles.dart that a new
document does not hold (No Spacing, Strong, Emphasis, Table Grid,
Hyperlink, Header, Footer and their linked styles) are taken from
test/fixtures/owner/docx/builtins.docx, saved by Microsoft Word for Mac
16.114, with the revision identifiers removed and the style ids and names
normalised to Word's en-US ones. The others come from the blank document
above. Whether that XML may ship under this package's licence is an open
question for the owner, not settled here.
